  "zh": "# 本周 AI 领域迎来模型、硬件及应用三线突破\n## AI 模型\n- **System One 发布**：提出融合推理与记忆的新架构，或将改变大模型训练范式。\n- **Gemini 3.8 发布**：谷歌最新多模态实时模型，性能提升显著引发业界关注。\n## AI 硬件与基础设施\n- **推理硬件革命 发布**：IEEE 文章详述新一代推理芯片趋势，预示算力格局将被重塑。\n- **Cloudflare 拒绝 AI 爬虫**：通过限制 AI 训练爬虫，保护网站内容同时引发数据合规讨论。\n## AI 应用与开发者工具\n- **Cartesian 3D 建模**：Formas 推出 AI 辅助 3D 建模平台，降低设计门槛提升效率。\n- **vivo 开发者大会**：vivo 发布多项 AI 功能及开发者套件，加速端侧 AI 生态建设。",
  "en": "# This week AI sees breakthroughs in models, hardware and applications\n## AI Models\n- **System One Release**：Introduces a new architecture merging reasoning and memory, potentially reshaping LLM training paradigms.\n- **Gemini 3.8 Release**：Google’s latest multimodal real-time model delivers notable performance gains, attracting broad industry attention.\n## AI Hardware & Infra\n- **Inference Hardware Revolution Release**：IEEE article outlines next‑gen inference chip trends, signalling a shift in the compute landscape.\n- **Cloudflare Blocks AI Crawlers**：By restricting AI training bots, Cloudflare protects site content while sparking data‑compliance debates.\n## AI Applications & Tools\n- **Cartesian 3D Modeling**：Formas launches an AI‑assisted 3D‑modeling platform that lowers design barriers and boosts efficiency.\n- **vivo Developer Conference**：vivo unveils multiple AI features and SDKs, accelerating on‑device AI ecosystem growth."
